[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 16264.83, "timestamp": "04:31:04", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16268.71, "timestamp": "04:31:08", "text": "你，可是箱子在哪儿呢？我不知道。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16272.149, "timestamp": "04:31:12", "text": "我知道我只是和你一起来的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16277.95, "timestamp": "04:31:17", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16294.95, "timestamp": "04:31:34", "text": "离开，我在这里，我可以把呕吐物放进去吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16298.109, "timestamp": "04:31:38", "text": "普通武器"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16302.109, "timestamp": "04:31:42", "text": "至少我们可以试试，哦，天哪，我们可以试试，来吧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16304.91, "timestamp": "04:31:44", "text": "试试用普通的剑之类的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16307.95, "timestamp": "04:31:47", "text": "只需添加火元素，它就完成了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16310.75, "timestamp": "04:31:50", "text": "正常情况下的毛发"}]